# Q30 Is a comparison or roll-up a second measure? No: an operational metric lists what it is asked against, as views of one measure.
PREFIX kpi: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/kpi/>
PREFIX kind: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/kpi/measure-kind/>
PREFIX measure: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/kpi/measure/>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
SELECT ?measure ?comparedAgainst WHERE {
  ?measure kpi:measureKind kind:operational-metric ; kpi:comparedAgainst ?comparedAgainst .
}
